5}],"sentences":[{"sentence_id":"phrasing_006_s0","report_id":"phrasing_006","text":"Lab Report: Training dynamics of deep models","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_006_s1","report_id":"phrasing_006","text":"In this report we compare several models on standard benchmarks.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_006_s2","report_id":"phrasing_006","text":"We trained each model for 100 epochs with a batch size of 64.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_006_s3","report_id":"phrasing_006","text":"The dataset was split into 80 percent training data and the rest for testing.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_006_s4","report_id":"phrasing_006","text":"Figure 1 shows the validation accuracy of MLP by dataset.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_006_s5","report_id":"phrasing_006","text":"As shown in Figure 1, MLP posts 72.3% validation accuracy when tested on AG News.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_006_s6","report_id":"phrasing_006","text":"MLP posts 70.0% validation accuracy when tested on MNIST.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_006_s7","report_id":"phrasing_006","text":"Figure 2 shows the validation accuracy by dataset.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_006_s8","report_id":"phrasing_006","text":"Evaluated on AG News, GRU comes in at 84.8% validation accuracy.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_006_s9","report_id":"phrasing_006","text":"Evaluated on AG News, GRU comes in at 71.0% validation accuracy.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_006_s10","report_id":"phrasing_006","text":"On IMDB, Ours obtains a validation accuracy of 31.7%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_006_s11","report_id":"phrasing_006","text":"Figure 3 shows the validation accuracy by dataset.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_006_s12","report_id":"phrasing_006","text":"On SST-2, ResNet-50 obtains a validation accuracy of 60.4%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_006_s13","report_id":"phrasing_006","text":"On AG News, DistilBERT is 4.6 points better than ResNet-50.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_006_s14","report_id":"phrasing_006","text":"Figure 4 shows the test accuracy during training.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_006_s15","report_id":"phrasing_006","text":"The test accuracy of EfficientNet improves by a relative 11% between epoch 5 and epoch 10.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_006_s16","report_id":"phrasing_006","text":"As shown in Figure 4, The test accuracy of BERT-base improves by a relative 14.5% between epoch 5 and epoch 10.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_006_s17","report_id":"phrasing_006","text":"Epoch 15 sees Baseline post a test accuracy of 77.3%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_006_s18","report_id":"phrasing_006","text":"By epoch 10, the test accuracy of BERT-base stands at 79.4%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_006_s19","report_id":"phrasing_006","text":"On MNIST, Logistic Regression obtains an accuracy of 60.0%.","page":2,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_006_s20","report_id":"phrasing_006","text":"The differences between the models are discussed in the next section.","page":2,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"}]}